<title>USA: Frankfort First sets 5 pct shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Frankfort First sets 5 pct shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFORT, Ky. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frankfort First Bancorp Inc said on Wednesday it was starting a program to repurchase up to five percent, or 172,500 shares, of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>Frankfort First President and Chief Executive Officer William Jennings said in a statement the buyback should be completed within nine months.</p>
</text>
